    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        600.6392822265625,
        527.135498046875,
        613.7843017578125
      ],
      "text": "Three studies (95 participants, including 35 people with TB) assessed the accuracy of LC-mNAATs",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        616.1392822265625,
        526.9616088867188,
        629.2843017578125
      ],
      "text": "for detecting lymph node TB using lymph node tissue from biopsy and an MRS ( ).  Fig. 2.2.1.8",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        631.6392822265625,
        526.9794311523438,
        644.7843017578125
      ],
      "text": "The estimated sensitivities were between 93% and 100%, and specificities were between",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        647.1392822265625,
        526.969970703125,
        660.2843017578125
      ],
      "text": "88% and 100%. The summary sensitivity was 94.3% (95% CI: 79.8–98.6), and the summary",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        662.6392822265625,
        526.6633911132812,
        675.7843017578125
      ],
      "text": "specificity was 90.0% (95% CI: 79.5–95.4). The certainty of evidence was low for both sensitivity",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.963288307189941,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        678.1392822265625,
        527.0869750976562,
        691.2843017578125
      ],
      "text": "and specificity. Due to limited data, a recommendation on using LC-mNAATs with lymph node",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.990946769714355,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        693.6392822265625,
        347.6435852050781,
        706.7843017578125
      ],
      "text": "tissue for the detection of lymph node TB was not made.",
